  m_text: '<b>Expect:</b> Play mode: Show On blinks the title out at once and fades
    it in 0.8 s later. Show Off leaves the title visible for 0.8 s, then snaps it
    invisible and fades it in - the flash this setting prevents. The preview always
    starts from the first frame, so both look like Show On there.'
