  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: E6
  Title: TO carries on, FROM starts over
  Summary: A step with no From travels from wherever the value is; with a From it
    always jumps there first.
  Watch: To Only, From And To
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 575354839}
  - {fileID: 659789644}
  HowTo: Play <b>Grow</b>, and while it's still growing press <b>Shrink</b>. Then
    press Grow again once Shrink has finished.
  Expect: 'Pressing Shrink mid-grow first finishes Grow (the preview finishes a running
    animation before playing another), then both shrink smoothly from 1.3. The second
    Grow: To Only grows smoothly from 1; From And To snaps to 0.5 first.'
  Needs: 1
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
