  Title: 'Old data: From set to Current'
  Summary: A step saved before the From dropdown lost Current still shows it, and
    behaves like the button reading TO.
  Watch: Box
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1416266327}
  HowTo: Open Old Step's step. Hover its From dropdown. Play <b>Old Step</b>.
  Expect: 'The From row shows Current with a tooltip explaining it. Opening the dropdown
    doesn''t offer Current. Play ignores the From of -500: Box slides from where
    it is to 200 right of rest. Nothing is rewritten.'
