  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: E4
  Title: 'To: Absolute, Baseline, Current'
  Summary: What a To value means in each mode.
  Watch: Absolute, Baseline, Current
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 717085142}
  - {fileID: 899910683}
  - {fileID: 1981004910}
  HowTo: Preview <b>Nudge</b>. Then in play mode click the Nudge button three times
    (waiting for each), then Home.
  Expect: Absolute and Baseline land on their outlines every time. Current moves
    140 further on every click in play mode, wandering off the stage; Home brings
    everything back. In the preview, Nudge replays from where it started, so Current
    never wanders there.
